Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4935730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4935730","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:16Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4935730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4935730","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:16Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4935730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1847286114029360","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"The Depths Are Awakening!","summary":"Hello, Architects! 🏰Steam Next Fest is underway, and while some adventurers are still trying to survive the demo, I've been busy working on content for the full game.This time, I decided to explore two very different settings: the depths of the abyss and a pirate tavern.After all, even pirates need somewhere to grab a drink. And sea monsters deserve a home too.But before I show you what's new, there's something I want to officially confirm:Fame & Fear: Dungeon Architect will launch in version 1.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:52:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029360","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:29:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1846651706678806","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"Cursed Carnival & 10 New Traps: Let the Show Begin!","summary":"Hello, Architects!The dungeon already had monsters, traps, and a questionable approach to safety. What it was missing was clowns.This update introduces Cursed Carnival, a new theme featuring decorations, building pieces, and two creatures ready to take charge of the entertainment. Joining them are ten new animated traps, spread across the progression up to Rank SS.This time, the focus is on variety: more ways to decorate your dungeon, plan your routes, and give adventurers a thoroughly questiona","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T17:54:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678806","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1846018067940526","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"Your Dungeon Comes Alive! New Strategies, Keeper's Orders & the Grand Expedition","summary":"Hello, Architects! Over the past few days, we've been working on one of the biggest updates yet for Fame & Fear: Dungeon Architect.Our goal was simple: make every decision matter and turn your dungeon into a place that truly reacts to the choices you make.We've introduced new tools to plan your days, understand adventurer behavior, intervene during visits, and discover which strategies actually work.But that's not all! There's also a completely revamped early-game experience, major improvements ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T10:16:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940526","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1845383656392830","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"update","title":"More Room for Your Dungeon: UI, Inns, and Combat Update","summary":"Hello, architects!This update focuses on how you build, manage, and watch your dungeon. I’ve reorganized the interface to leave more room for the game itself, expanded the furniture you can use in inns, and worked on animations and effects to make adventurers’ and monsters’ actions easier to follow.There are also changes to admission spending, rank promotion costs, and daily reports. Here’s what’s new.A More Compact, Organized InterfaceMore dungeon, fewer open panels. The new “Compact Book” HUD ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T08:23:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392830","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1845383656386762","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"A More Alive Dungeon: Taverns, Returning Visitors, Chronicles & More!","summary":"Hello, Keepers!Since the last update, we’ve been working hard on Fame & Fear: Dungeon Architect. This time, the focus hasn’t just been on adding more content, but on making the dungeon feel more alive, easier to read, and more personal.The biggest addition is without a doubt the arrival of Taverns.Build and Manage Your Own TavernYou can now build fully functional taverns inside your dungeon, complete with a main hall, tables, chairs, a counter, and private rooms for overnight guests.Adventurers ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T15:28:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386762","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1844751498225895","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"The Desert Tomb is open!","summary":"Well… someone opened a tomb that probably would have been better left closed.The Desert Tomb Pack has arrived in Fame & Fear: Dungeon Architect.The new theme brings 13 new elements, bringing the catalog up to 98 modular pieces of content.You’ll find a new themed floor, wall and door, new braziers, and several decorations to build proper tombs, burial chambers and corridors that aren’t exactly welcoming.And of course, someone had to be there to guard all of this.Anubis GuardianA new monster enter","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T20:37:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225895","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1844115010495202","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"Something made this place its home… The Spider Pack is here!","summary":"Did you think the dungeon already had enough legs?Well… apparently not.The Spider Pack is here, a new themed set designed to turn your rooms into places no sane adventurer would probably want to visit.The pack introduces 8 new decorations, along with a new themed wall and door, so you can build proper infested lairs and finally give your rooms that lovely “maybe I shouldn’t be here” feeling.And of course, she had to be included.The Spider QueenA new boss enters the dungeon, ready to personally w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T15:26:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495202","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1843481262701740","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"Hey... Max is here!","summary":"Well... apparently the dungeon has a voice now.Meet Max, the new dungeon radio host.He’ll comment on what happens during the day, and sometimes he’ll just talk because the silence is getting awkward. After all, he doesn’t exactly have anything better to do… he’s chained to the studio!But Max isn’t the only new thing in this update.Adventurers can now leave gold on the ground when they’re defeated, and other adventurers might pick it up before you do.The dungeon can also get dirty now. Trash and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T13:54:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701740","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1843481262693304","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"Blueprint Workshop – Small Demo Fix","summary":"A small update regarding the Blueprint system.Due to a Steam limitation, Blueprints created in the Demo cannot currently be published to the Steam Workshop.For this reason, I’ve disabled the Publish to Workshop button in the Demo to avoid confusion.You can still create, save and reuse your Blueprint rooms normally.The full version will retain Steam Workshop publishing support.Thanks for the reports!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T20:05:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262693304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1843481262692446","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"He has a skeleton in the closet... literally!","summary":"Well, here we are… again.This time with a pretty important update: the dungeon is evolving.Over the past few days I’ve been working on new content, and the catalog has now grown to over 70 items.You can finally create rooms that are darker or more welcoming. I’m not here to judge.I’ve also introduced the first themed pack: the Necromancer Pack is here. I mean, what kind of dungeon would it be without one?New monsters, decorations and traps are ready to keep your customers properly entertained.Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T14:41:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692446","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1842846814451264","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Live!","summary":"Okay, here we are. For real this time.The demo of Fame & Fear: Dungeon Architect is finally available.It feels a bit strange to say that after all the time spent building rooms, placing traps, fixing monsters and, above all, trying to understand why every now and then an adventurer would decide to do something that made absolutely no sense.But here we are.Starting today, you can jump into the game and try building your own dungeon.Dig, build, place treasure wherever you want, hire monsters, set ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T16:59:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451264","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935730-1842846814439619","game_id":"steam-4935730","kind":"announcement","title":"T